{"speciesId":85,"names":{"fr":"Dodrio","es":"Dodrio","en":"Dodrio","ja":"ドードリオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Uses its three brains to execute complex plans. While two heads sleep, one head stays awake."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Uses its three brains to execute complex plans. While two heads sleep, one head stays awake."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"One of DODUO's 2 heads splits to form a unique species. It runs close to 40 MPH in prairies."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It collects data and plans three times as wisely, but it may think too much and be­ come immobilized."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If one of the heads gets to eat, the others will be satisfied, too, and they will stop squabbling."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"An enemy that takes its eyes off any of the three heads--even for a second--will get pecked severely."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Watch out if DODRIO’s three heads are looking in three separate directions. It’s a sure sign that it is on its guard. Don’t go near this POKéMON if it’s being wary - it may decide to peck you."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Apparently, the heads aren’t the only parts of the body that DODRIO has three of. It has three sets of hearts and lungs as well, so it is capable of running long distances without rest."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A peculiar POKéMON species with three heads. It vigorously races across grassy plains even in arid seasons with little rainfall."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Uses its three brains to execute complex plans. While two heads sleep, one head is said to stay awake."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It collects data and plans three times as wisely, but it may think too much and fall into a state of immobility."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If one of the heads gets to eat, the others will be satisfied, too, and they will stop squabbling."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand Doduo connaît cette étrange évolution, l’une de ses têtes se dédouble. Il atteint les 60 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand Doduo connaît cette étrange évolution, l’une de ses têtes se dédouble. Il atteint les 60 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un ennemi ne faisant pas attention à l’une des trois têtes pendant une seconde se fait picorer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Más vale no perder de vista ninguna de las tres cabezas. De lo contrario, el número de picotazos será enorme."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"An enemy that takes its eyes off any of the three heads--even for a second--will get pecked severely."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"３つの 頭が 見ている前で わずかでも すきを 見せると クチバシで 激しく つつかれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Une espèce étrange que l’on trouve rarement. Les trois têtes représentent la joie, la tristesse et la colère."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es una especie muy rara y difícil de encontrar. Las tres cabezas simbolizan la alegría, la tristeza y la ira."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"めったに 見つからない 珍種。 ３つの 頭は 喜び 悲しみ 怒りの 感情を 表す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il faut se méfier lorsque les trois têtes de Dodrio regardent dans des directions différentes. Cela signifie qu’il est sur ses gardes. Si c’est le cas, il vaut mieux ne pas s’approcher de ce Pokémon, il pourrait décider d’attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Según parece, las cabezas no son las únicas partes del cuerpo que tiene triplicadas. Dodrio también tiene tres corazones y tres pares de pulmones. Con esta constitución, puede correr largas distancias sin cansarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Watch out if Dodrio’s three heads are looking in three separate directions. It’s a sure sign that it is on its guard. Don’t go near this Pokémon if it’s being wary—it may decide to peck you."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"３つの 頭が 別々の 方向を 向いている ときは 警戒している 証拠。 うかつに 近寄ると くちばしで 突かれるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Apparemment, Dodrio ne se contente pas d’avoir trois têtes. Il semble également avoir trois cœurs et six poumons, ce qui lui permet de courir très longtemps sans s’épuiser."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Según parece, las cabezas no son las únicas partes del cuerpo que tiene triplicadas. Dodrio también tiene tres corazones y tres pares de pulmones. Con esta constitución, puede correr largas distancias sin cansarse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Apparently, the heads aren’t the only parts of the body that Dodrio has three of. It has three sets of hearts and lungs as well, so it is capable of running long distances without rest."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"３つあるのは 頭だけでは ないらしい。 心臓と 肺も ３つなので 息切れしないで 長い 距離を 走る ことが できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Quand une des têtes de Doduo se divise, il devient un Dodrio capable de courir à 60 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Este Pokémon surge al dividirse una de las cabezas de Doduo. Es capaz de correr por las praderas a 60 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"One of Doduo’s two heads splits to form a unique species. It runs close to 40 mph in prairies."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ドードーの どちらかの 頭が 分裂した 変種。草原を 時速 ６０キロで 走っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Quand une des têtes de Doduo se divise, il devient un Dodrio capable de courir à 60 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Este Pokémon surge al dividirse una de las cabezas de Doduo. Es capaz de correr por las praderas a 60 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"One of Doduo’s two heads splits to form a unique species. It runs close to 40 mph in prairies."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ドードーの どちらかの 頭が 分裂した 変種。草原を 時速 ６０キロで 走っていく。"}],"varieties":[{"id":85,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"level-up",38],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",38],[18,"machine",0],[19,"level-up",37],[23,"level-up",38],[23,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",34],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[23,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[25,"egg",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],